    "teach_3_step": {
      "id": "teach_3_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "So x = 7k and y = 11k for some k.\n\nSubstitute:\n\n28k + 55k = 83\n83k = 83 → k = 1\n\nx = 7, y = 11, and y − x = 4.\n\nA ratio fixes the shape; the equation fixes the size.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_3"
        }
      ]
    },
