    "teach_4": {
      "id": "teach_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Three unknowns need three equations:\n\n2x + 3y + z = 55\nx + z − y = 4\ny − x + z = 12",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_4_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_4_step": {
      "id": "teach_4_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Subtract pairs to shrink the system:\n\nFirst minus second: x + 4y = 51\nFirst minus third: 3x + 2y = 43\n\nNow it's a two-equation problem. Double the second:\n6x + 4y = 86\nminus the first: 5x = 35 → x = 7",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_4_step2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_4_step2": {
      "id": "teach_4_step2",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Back-substitute:\n\n7 + 4y = 51 → y = 11\n2(7) + 3(11) + z = 55 → z = 8\n\nCheck in an unused equation: 7 + 8 − 11 = 4 ✓",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_4"
        }
      ]
    },
